      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "1. Cat \u2014 \u0642\u0637 (qi\u1E6D\u1E6D)\nA small domesticated animal
    known for its agility and independence; often kept as a pet and loved for its
    soft fur and playful behavior.\n\n2. Dog \u2014 \u0643\u0644\u0628 (kalb)\nA
    loyal domesticated animal known for guarding, herding, and companionship; often
    trained to help humans in daily tasks.\n\n3. Bird \u2014 \u0637\u0627\u0626\u0631
    (\u1E6D\u0101\u2019ir)\nA feathered animal capable of flying, singing, and nesting
    in trees; found in many environments around the world.\n\n4. Fish \u2014 \u0633\u0645\u0643\u0629
    (samakah)\nA water-dwelling animal that breathes through gills and swims using
    fins; commonly found in rivers, lakes, and oceans.\n\n5. Cow \u2014 \u0628\u0642\u0631\u0629
    (baqarah)\nA large farm animal raised for milk, meat, and labor; often seen grazing
    in fields and known for its gentle nature.\n\n6. Sheep \u2014 \u062E\u0631\u0648\u0641
    (khar\u016Bf)\nA farm animal covered with wool, often raised for meat and wool;
    known for its calm and herd-like behavior.\n\n7. Horse \u2014 \u062D\u0635\u0627\u0646
    (\u1E25i\u1E63\u0101n)\nA strong and fast-running animal used for riding, transport,
    and sport; recognized for its elegance and speed.\n\n8. Lion \u2014 \u0623\u0633\u062F
    (asad)\nA large wild cat known as the \u201Cking of the jungle\u201D; powerful
    and social, living in groups called prides.\n\n9. Elephant \u2014 \u0641\u064A\u0644
    (f\u012Bl)\nA giant land animal with a long trunk and tusks; highly intelligent
    and often found in savannas or forests.\n\n10. Monkey \u2014 \u0642\u0631\u062F
    (qird)\nA playful and intelligent animal that lives in trees; known for its agility,
    curiosity, and expressive behavior."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 41fcd37ec38e5a5458c385a8d00f4d94, type: 2}
